{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, how's it going? Last week I went on a trip to Canada and something unreal happened - I met this awesome Canadian woman and it was like something out of a movie. She's incredible and being with her makes me feel alive."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-3b78e00f7764ca97a6a8e853", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.164243+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3b78e00f7764ca97a6a8e853", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3b78e00f7764ca97a6a8e853", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Congrats Evan! She must be something special! Being with someone who makes you feel alive is amazing. I'm sorry to hear that you're dealing with health issues lately, it can be really tough. It's hard to fully enjoy things sometimes."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-49c48615128fd3dcdc50fe0f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.191242+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "49c48615128fd3dcdc50fe0f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "49c48615128fd3dcdc50fe0f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Woah. such a nice view! Thanks, Sam! She's definitely great. Every moment with her is really fun and energizing. It's a nice change, especially after dealing with health issues. But you never know what life's gonna throw at you. Btw look what life has thrown for me right now haha."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-a2854a5c1def9954a39363f9", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.205511+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a2854a5c1def9954a39363f9", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a2854a5c1def9954a39363f9", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Looks good to eat! Dealing with health problems can be challenging and take away from enjoyable experiences."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-44d06f4d0b805071aed73d5b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.223369+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "44d06f4d0b805071aed73d5b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "44d06f4d0b805071aed73d5b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Ginger snaps are my weakness for sure! Dealing with health issues has been tough, but it's made me appreciate the good moments more. These are the ones who bring lots of joy even through the hard times."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-5515014b67ac88b913796147", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.233253+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5515014b67ac88b913796147", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5515014b67ac88b913796147", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: It looks like your kids are having a great time! And how long have you been prioritizing your health?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-8e29858b1210747bd61eb0c7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.247138+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8e29858b1210747bd61eb0c7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8e29858b1210747bd61eb0c7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yes, they bring me such joy. My healthy road has been a long one. I've been working on it for two years now, so there have been ups and downs, but I'm doing my best."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-57da6d6c3cf72602040d3140", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.260736+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "57da6d6c3cf72602040d3140", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "57da6d6c3cf72602040d3140", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: I wish your motivation never goes anywhere! I'm thinking of ordering myself some similar ones too, what do you think, are they worth it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-9a560c0dae6b8cf5ac80f367", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.274713+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "9a560c0dae6b8cf5ac80f367", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "9a560c0dae6b8cf5ac80f367", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks Sam! My family motivates me to stay healthy. Well, it helps a lot with my health goals. It tracks my progress really well and serves as a constant reminder to keep going."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-b9f02c83d2eb105a31624492", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.287319+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b9f02c83d2eb105a31624492", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b9f02c83d2eb105a31624492", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Cool! It sounds like a really good tool to stay on track. How has it been working out for you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-3c35618c73024e71582c18dc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.300855+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3c35618c73024e71582c18dc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3c35618c73024e71582c18dc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: It's been awesome, Sam! That visual reminder has been really motivating."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-f5e53e621a486fba0e2884ce", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.311817+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f5e53e621a486fba0e2884ce", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f5e53e621a486fba0e2884ce", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks for the recommendation, what else motivates you?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-af1c4557b7cc94d3da14dd4a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.323502+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "af1c4557b7cc94d3da14dd4a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "af1c4557b7cc94d3da14dd4a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: I'm motivated by a thirst for adventure on interesting hikes, that's pretty cool!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-eed2512f9f5383fa6c126e65", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.337078+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "eed2512f9f5383fa6c126e65", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "eed2512f9f5383fa6c126e65", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: What an amazing view! The key is to find something that keeps you motivated."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-171f239bfd5d99083706c392", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.344270+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "171f239bfd5d99083706c392", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "171f239bfd5d99083706c392", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yep, that's it. Find something that motivates you and makes you happy, whether it's large or tiny. It'll help us conquer the struggles we encounter."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-93dd9020ca9a2cc349cd280b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.360353+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "93dd9020ca9a2cc349cd280b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "93dd9020ca9a2cc349cd280b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Nice! What made you decide to get that?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-d8bc5b4a4b1125ced37b5554", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.373152+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d8bc5b4a4b1125ced37b5554", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d8bc5b4a4b1125ced37b5554", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: I got this because it symbolizes strength and resilience. Taking care of it motivates me to keep going through tough times."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-91739dbc0ea762a92855fd3f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.382675+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "91739dbc0ea762a92855fd3f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "91739dbc0ea762a92855fd3f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Wow, it's amazing! So powerful yet so simple."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-602405657af98546cdd11741", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.396076+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "602405657af98546cdd11741", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "602405657af98546cdd11741", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Thanks, Sam. It's a reminder that even in little things, we can be tough."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-ab97ad6a63cce76473cf4325", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.405076+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ab97ad6a63cce76473cf4325", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ab97ad6a63cce76473cf4325", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Little stuff matters - it builds our resilience over time."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-a716cd72ea287332d0903e02", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.415826+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a716cd72ea287332d0903e02", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a716cd72ea287332d0903e02", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yeah, every little thing we do for ourselves helps us in the long run."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-53d47bf318de59514b90472a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.426838+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "53d47bf318de59514b90472a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "53d47bf318de59514b90472a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Yep, small steps add up. Stay consistent and don't give up!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-1d2ea39ded559f5e72d7a07a", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.434300+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1d2ea39ded559f5e72d7a07a", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1d2ea39ded559f5e72d7a07a", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yep, Sam! Consistency and perseverance will get us far. Great chat!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_5-596b5327b08735cafeb6cdce", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:01:49.448200+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "596b5327b08735cafeb6cdce", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "596b5327b08735cafeb6cdce", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
